WEBVTT

01:30.510 --> 01:34.900
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.160 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 15]

01:38.070 --> 01:39.270
It's time to bring out

01:40.000 --> 01:41.400
the extra dishes as well.

02:10.479 --> 02:11.090
Xiao Yao!

02:11.150 --> 02:12.430
Xiao Yao!

02:19.120 --> 02:20.370
Xiao Yao!

02:21.800 --> 02:23.329
What should we do, Xiao Yao?

02:23.350 --> 02:24.520
Dali, hang in there!

02:39.840 --> 02:41.600
Hong Ye once said that vengeful spirits

02:41.600 --> 02:44.200
favor the chill of yin
and fear the heat of yang.

02:48.750 --> 02:49.320
Dali,

02:49.990 --> 02:52.520
do you remember the Wind-Control Technique
Xiao Ming taught us?

02:52.520 --> 02:52.960
Yes.

02:53.590 --> 02:55.050
Follow my lead in a moment.

02:55.310 --> 02:55.870
Okay.

03:24.680 --> 03:25.490
Don't see me.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.350
Don't see me.

03:26.380 --> 03:27.360
Don't see me!

03:47.200 --> 03:48.000
Now!

03:48.760 --> 03:50.220
Wind-Control Technique!

04:06.890 --> 04:07.460
Xiao Yao.

04:07.620 --> 04:08.940
Xiao Yao, are you okay?

04:10.910 --> 04:11.470
I'm okay.

04:22.430 --> 04:23.190
Xiao Yao,

04:23.510 --> 04:25.040
why did you make such a big fire?

04:25.040 --> 04:26.970
The candles are almost burned out.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.920
The vengeful spirits are gone.

04:28.920 --> 04:31.180
Does that mean we've cleared this level?

04:33.070 --> 04:35.400
Why is it that
we still can't open the door?

04:35.950 --> 04:36.630
Exactly.

04:36.830 --> 04:38.390
According to what Pianpian said,

04:38.390 --> 04:40.650
we should have cleared this level by now.

04:53.920 --> 04:55.320
Why are there four exits?

04:56.120 --> 04:57.030
Dali,

04:57.310 --> 04:58.770
which one is the real exit?

04:58.870 --> 04:59.680
Exactly.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.940
Which way should we go?

05:02.950 --> 05:03.720
Xiao Yao,

05:04.790 --> 05:06.450
what do you think we should do?

05:08.430 --> 05:10.360
The candlelight's back to normal.

05:10.750 --> 05:12.410
Looks like all four doors will work.

05:12.410 --> 05:13.360
Yeah, that's right.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.020
They should all be connected.

05:15.040 --> 05:15.780
Dali,

05:15.930 --> 05:17.660
which one are you going to take?

05:20.630 --> 05:21.290
Follow her.

05:21.540 --> 05:22.580
Dali, wait for me!

05:22.840 --> 05:24.110
And me, Dali!

05:24.240 --> 05:25.040
Wait up!

05:32.970 --> 05:34.570
I'll go check this side then.

05:35.960 --> 05:37.020
I'll take this one.

05:41.270 --> 05:41.960
Xiao Yao,

05:42.600 --> 05:44.560
let me wipe your face clean first.

05:49.250 --> 05:49.850
Thank you.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.810
They got lucky.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.040
The next level

05:53.310 --> 05:54.840
will be the real challenge.

06:09.430 --> 06:10.360
What's the rush?

06:10.710 --> 06:11.910
Don't you fear death?

06:55.680 --> 06:57.950
The mechanisms in this courtyard
are even more bizarre.

06:57.950 --> 07:00.350
You'd better observe carefully yourself.

07:25.310 --> 07:27.480
Little Leaf, give me a hint.

07:28.480 --> 07:30.070
Won't you use your brain at all?

07:30.070 --> 07:31.920
Want me to flick your forehead?

07:32.830 --> 07:34.430
Look at these stone statues.

07:34.430 --> 07:35.830
None of them have hearts.

07:36.630 --> 07:37.960
What do you mean by that?

07:38.600 --> 07:40.810
So you want me to draw hearts on them?

07:41.800 --> 07:43.070
One's appearance is a reflection
of their heart,

07:43.070 --> 07:44.710
and the heart spawns five ghosts:

07:44.710 --> 07:45.480
jealousy,

07:47.110 --> 07:47.909
vanity,

07:48.750 --> 07:49.640
greed,

07:50.470 --> 07:51.310
sloth,

07:52.090 --> 07:53.450
and schadenfreude.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.780
What's that supposed to mean?

08:02.850 --> 08:04.160
Figure it out yourself.

08:04.160 --> 08:05.240
No more hints.

08:07.560 --> 08:09.090
Leaving things half-said—

08:09.360 --> 08:10.560
what's your problem?

08:32.750 --> 08:34.350
Why won't this candle light?

08:54.630 --> 08:55.340
Xiao Yao.

08:55.870 --> 08:57.440
Thanks for saving us just now.

08:57.440 --> 08:59.240
If you need any help, just ask.

08:59.790 --> 09:00.200
Yeah.

09:07.360 --> 09:08.200
Xiao Yao.

09:08.200 --> 09:09.320
As expected, you're the best.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.380
You figured out the trick right away.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.440
I've always known
Xiao Yao was extraordinary.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.000
Look.

09:14.000 --> 09:15.600
We only made it through earlier
thanks to Xiao Yao.

09:15.600 --> 09:16.360
-Exactly.
-That's right.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.150
Dali.

09:17.750 --> 09:19.870
-What about us? What should we do?
-Xiao Yao, had I known you were this good,

09:19.870 --> 09:21.200
I would've stuck with you
from the very beginning.

09:21.200 --> 09:21.670
Exactly.

09:21.670 --> 09:23.790
Yeah. I wish I had followed you
from the start.

09:23.790 --> 09:24.360
Indeed.

09:24.360 --> 09:27.200
Alright, everyone, let's focus on
finding clues first.

09:27.200 --> 09:28.510
As long as we don't fight among ourselves,

09:28.510 --> 09:29.720
I believe we'll be able to pass the trial.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.200
-Alright.
-Okay.

09:30.200 --> 09:30.510
Mm.

09:30.510 --> 09:31.040
Alright.

09:48.150 --> 09:50.440
A few compliments
and she's acting all high and mighty.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.910
If we followed all her instructions,

09:51.910 --> 09:54.510
we'd be sending her straight into
the Immortal Lord's favor for nothing.

09:54.510 --> 09:57.110
Just butter her up a bit
to her face, that's all.

10:17.150 --> 10:19.270
How come their clothes look so nice?

10:19.790 --> 10:21.270
They don't know how to do anything,

10:21.270 --> 10:23.510
yet they've been pampered since childhood.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.370
And look at her—

10:24.480 --> 10:26.120
there's actually jade on her shoes.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.480
One pair costs as much as

10:27.480 --> 10:28.630
all the clothes my father and I

10:28.630 --> 10:30.480
have ever worn combined.

10:30.840 --> 10:31.750
Xiao Yao.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.200
Ning'an.

10:46.080 --> 10:48.390
All Hong Ye ever thinks of is you.

10:49.030 --> 10:50.630
What's so special about you?

10:57.960 --> 10:58.510
Xiao Yao?

10:58.720 --> 11:00.150
Xiao Yao, what's wrong with you?

11:00.150 --> 11:00.790
Xiao Yao!

11:01.240 --> 11:02.510
Xiao Yao, wake up!

11:07.870 --> 11:08.730
What am I doing?

11:09.030 --> 11:09.510
You...

11:09.840 --> 11:11.360
Can you hear me now?

11:12.390 --> 11:13.520
How did that happen?

11:13.630 --> 11:15.200
I wasn't myself just now.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.390
Who said you could touch me?

11:17.390 --> 11:18.390
How dare you touch me?

11:18.390 --> 11:19.360
Why did you hit me?

11:19.360 --> 11:20.390
I meant to hit you!

11:20.550 --> 11:21.600
-You started it!
-What are you doing?

11:21.600 --> 11:22.670
My father outranks yours,

11:22.670 --> 11:23.360
how dare you hit me!

11:23.360 --> 11:24.600
Stop arguing, both of you!

11:24.600 --> 11:25.550
What's wrong with practicing weapons?

11:25.550 --> 11:26.600
Someone as fragile as you

11:26.600 --> 11:27.870
would never be chosen
by the Immortal Lord!

11:27.870 --> 11:29.510
I'm better than you at everything—
music, chess, calligraphy, and painting.

11:29.510 --> 11:31.000
The Immortal Lord will surely favor me.

11:31.000 --> 11:31.910
-Why did you push me?
-And you.

11:31.910 --> 11:34.000
I call you Dali every day
and consider you my sister,

11:34.000 --> 11:35.150
but look what you've done!

11:35.150 --> 11:35.870
You're so useless!

11:35.870 --> 11:36.440
Exactly!

11:36.600 --> 11:37.720
Give me back my bracelet!

11:37.720 --> 11:38.360
What are you doing?

11:38.360 --> 11:39.150
Give it back to her!

11:39.150 --> 11:39.790
Look,

11:40.120 --> 11:41.550
everyone has changed.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.960
Don't forget, I'm a general's daughter!

11:43.960 --> 11:44.840
Who do you think you are?

11:44.840 --> 11:45.790
You dare push me?

11:45.790 --> 11:47.440
You? You're not worthy!

11:47.630 --> 11:49.690
I suddenly got really angry just now—

11:50.390 --> 11:53.080
angry at them for having
nice clothes and possessions.

11:53.080 --> 11:53.440
No,

11:53.960 --> 11:54.890
it wasn't anger.

11:55.180 --> 11:56.110
It was jealousy.

11:56.390 --> 11:58.050
I was jealous of them just now.

11:58.960 --> 12:00.230
Why did I suddenly...

12:00.270 --> 12:01.150
You think you're so tough, huh?

12:01.150 --> 12:01.940
How dare you talk about my father
like that!

12:01.940 --> 12:03.550
How dare you talk about my father
like that!

12:03.550 --> 12:04.150
Give it to me!

12:04.150 --> 12:05.080
Return it to her!

12:05.270 --> 12:06.360
How dare you talk about my father
like that!

12:06.360 --> 12:08.290
It's because of this stone statue.

12:08.790 --> 12:09.910
Give it back to her!

12:10.320 --> 12:11.240
Give it back to me!

12:11.240 --> 12:12.150
You didn't do anything!

12:12.150 --> 12:13.390
What right do you have to take anything?

12:13.390 --> 12:14.150
Exactly!

12:14.510 --> 12:15.710
Give it back to me now!

12:16.200 --> 12:16.790
Give it back!

12:16.790 --> 12:17.520
My bracelet!

12:17.670 --> 12:18.480
Who do you think you are to push me?

12:18.480 --> 12:19.540
You dare to resist?

12:19.720 --> 12:20.630
Are you crazy?

12:23.230 --> 12:24.600
One's appearance is a reflection
of their heart,

12:24.600 --> 12:26.460
and the heart spawns five ghosts:

12:26.750 --> 12:27.610
jealousy,

12:27.960 --> 12:28.480
vanity,

12:28.930 --> 12:29.880
greed,

12:30.500 --> 12:31.350
sloth,

12:32.120 --> 12:33.350
and schadenfreude.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.000
Get lost!

12:36.590 --> 12:37.570
I said get lost!

12:38.150 --> 12:39.010
Stop fighting!

12:39.480 --> 12:40.150
Let me go!

12:40.150 --> 12:40.970
Let go!

12:41.320 --> 12:42.030
Stop fighting!

12:42.030 --> 12:42.750
Stop fighting!

12:42.750 --> 12:43.440
Let go!

12:43.550 --> 12:45.010
Stop fighting, all of you!

12:45.150 --> 12:46.350
Stop fighting! Stop!

12:47.000 --> 12:48.150
Put some effort into it!

12:48.150 --> 12:48.900
Stop fighting!

12:48.900 --> 12:49.670
Stop it!

12:51.390 --> 12:52.920
It's none of your business!

12:53.200 --> 12:53.870
What are you doing?

12:53.870 --> 12:54.870
Give it back to me!

13:17.250 --> 13:18.590
I'll kill you!

13:19.550 --> 13:20.950
Give me back my bracelet!

13:21.030 --> 13:22.200
-What?
-How could you say that about us?

13:22.200 --> 13:22.750
Give it back to her!

13:22.750 --> 13:23.320
Let go!

13:24.150 --> 13:24.720
This is what you get for
talking about my father like that!

13:24.720 --> 13:25.450
Give it to me!

13:25.600 --> 13:26.720
Stop fighting, you all!

13:26.720 --> 13:27.910
Stop! Stop fighting!

13:27.910 --> 13:28.910
Give it back to me!

13:29.240 --> 13:29.960
Help!

13:30.120 --> 13:30.980
Stop fighting!

13:31.840 --> 13:32.790
This is her bracelet!

13:32.790 --> 13:33.910
Why did you take it?

13:35.150 --> 13:35.910
Hand it over!

13:37.510 --> 13:39.370
First the cause, then the effect.

13:39.600 --> 13:41.990
It was jealousy, vanity, and greed

13:42.390 --> 13:44.320
that turned us against each other.

13:55.100 --> 13:56.390
We can't let the stone statues
move anymore!

13:56.390 --> 13:56.980
Let go!

13:57.360 --> 13:58.360
These five stone statues

13:58.360 --> 13:59.980
are the cores of this formation.

13:59.980 --> 14:01.390
If the formation is completed,

14:01.390 --> 14:03.140
we might all die!

14:03.360 --> 14:04.720
Go away! Don't touch me!

14:06.510 --> 14:08.170
I need to get out of here alive.

14:08.440 --> 14:11.120
I still want to go out there
and enjoy wealth and glory.

14:11.120 --> 14:11.890
It's you!

14:20.790 --> 14:21.840
We can't let the stone statues move!

14:21.840 --> 14:22.960
What are you standing there for?

14:22.960 --> 14:23.840
Help me push!

14:27.080 --> 14:28.140
Come help quickly!

14:28.550 --> 14:29.410
Come on, hurry!

14:39.060 --> 14:40.240
How impressive.

14:41.160 --> 14:42.890
She figured out the formation.

14:43.530 --> 14:44.420
Too bad,

14:45.320 --> 14:46.750
it's already too late.

14:47.210 --> 14:49.790
The stone statues are about to
return to their positions.

14:49.790 --> 14:51.960
They'll be trapped in their own desires

14:51.960 --> 14:53.490
and never be able to escape.

14:55.910 --> 14:57.720
We and these stone statues
are bound by cause and effect,

14:57.720 --> 14:59.050
affecting one another.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.360
As long as we calm our minds,

15:00.360 --> 15:02.180
they won't be able to affect us!

15:07.910 --> 15:08.840
What do you mean?

15:09.210 --> 15:10.450
So you're saying

15:10.790 --> 15:12.190
we should do nothing now?

15:12.240 --> 15:13.360
Yes. Do nothing

15:13.360 --> 15:14.080
and think of nothing.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.630
What kind of solution is that?

15:15.630 --> 15:17.600
I think you're just trying to
get us killed as quickly as possible

15:17.600 --> 15:18.910
so you can reap the benefits yourself!

15:18.910 --> 15:19.670
That's right!

15:19.670 --> 15:21.030
We all know what's going on.

15:21.030 --> 15:23.240
You were the one who led us
to find the key to the last level.

15:23.240 --> 15:24.900
Now that none of us can get out,

15:25.000 --> 15:26.550
wouldn't all the credit
belong to you alone?

15:26.550 --> 15:27.630
I have absolutely no interest

15:27.630 --> 15:28.840
in the rewards!

15:29.080 --> 15:29.870
I only came here

15:29.870 --> 15:31.530
for someone who matters to me.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.670
The Immortal Lord surely set up this trial

15:34.670 --> 15:36.720
to select capable people

15:36.720 --> 15:37.620
for her own use.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.670
You're all daughters
from official families.

15:39.670 --> 15:41.130
I'm sure you've heard that

15:41.200 --> 15:43.270
only those who stay composed
in the face of Mount Tai collapsing

15:43.270 --> 15:44.600
can achieve great things.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.600
What does all this

15:45.600 --> 15:46.720
have to do with us?

15:51.630 --> 15:52.600
There's no other way now!

15:52.600 --> 15:53.790
You have to trust me!

15:55.150 --> 15:56.080
Close your eyes!

16:05.320 --> 16:05.960
Remember,

16:05.960 --> 16:06.870
if you can't calm your minds,

16:06.870 --> 16:08.330
think about happy things.

16:08.440 --> 16:10.000
Think about the people you love most.

16:10.000 --> 16:10.600
No matter what,

16:10.600 --> 16:12.330
just be happy and comfortable.

17:33.270 --> 17:34.720
They're gone. All gone.

17:40.270 --> 17:41.030
Great!

18:26.510 --> 18:27.510
It's seven notes.

18:27.790 --> 18:29.250
We've got all the strings.

18:29.350 --> 18:31.310
Then can we get out of here now?

18:32.000 --> 18:34.350
♪ The moonlight lingers ♪

18:34.350 --> 18:36.400
♪ My heart is heavy ♪

18:36.790 --> 18:41.200
♪ Past memories shackle my spirit ♪

18:41.680 --> 18:44.160
♪ Offer my flesh and blood ♪

18:44.160 --> 18:46.510
♪ Comfort my soul ♪

18:46.510 --> 18:50.240
♪ One person returns to the shadows,
while all others live ♪

18:50.240 --> 18:51.830
"Offer my flesh and blood."

18:52.790 --> 18:54.200
"Comfort my soul."

18:55.350 --> 18:58.590
"One person returns to the shadows,
while all others live."

18:58.590 --> 18:59.880
This means...

19:00.310 --> 19:02.680
They'll select someone from among us
to offer as a sacrifice

19:02.680 --> 19:05.010
to the vengeful spirits in the courtyard.

19:06.310 --> 19:10.110
♪ One person returns to the shadows,
while all others live ♪

19:44.910 --> 19:47.040
This last level is the most ingenious.

19:47.270 --> 19:49.080
As long as a life is truly sacrificed,

19:49.080 --> 19:51.750
it will completely enrage
that vengeful spirit.

19:51.750 --> 19:53.490
Once she goes into a frenzy...

20:03.790 --> 20:05.550
The one who draws the shortest stick

20:05.550 --> 20:07.880
must accept the outcome and admit defeat.

20:07.880 --> 20:08.680
Go ahead and draw.

20:08.680 --> 20:09.480
I'll go first.

20:14.830 --> 20:15.310
Hurry.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.070
Dali,

20:24.400 --> 20:25.720
which one should I choose?

20:25.720 --> 20:27.980
It's your own fate. Why are you asking me?

20:45.880 --> 20:46.880
Go. Go over there.

20:50.680 --> 20:51.410
I won't draw.

20:52.790 --> 20:53.400
Xiao Yao,

20:54.510 --> 20:56.960
why do you always have to
make yourself stand out?

20:56.960 --> 20:58.560
I'm just following my heart.

21:00.410 --> 21:02.140
The candle is almost burnt out.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.160
Is what your heart wants

21:04.400 --> 21:06.730
more important than
the lives of all of us?

21:07.510 --> 21:07.960
Fine.

21:08.510 --> 21:09.570
I'll choose first.

21:12.270 --> 21:13.530
This one is yours then.

21:15.400 --> 21:17.000
Everyone, show your sticks.

21:23.750 --> 21:25.350
They're all the same length.

21:25.550 --> 21:27.720
Did you make the sticks wrong?

21:27.790 --> 21:29.450
Who hasn't shown their stick?

21:30.550 --> 21:31.440
Who is it? Who else?

21:31.440 --> 21:33.550
Huang Ying! Huang Ying
hasn't shown her stick.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.750
Huang Ying, show it already.

21:34.750 --> 21:36.680
What are you afraid of, Huang Ying?

21:38.210 --> 21:39.670
Her stick is the shortest!

22:07.160 --> 22:08.640
Accept the outcome and admit defeat.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.400
That's right. Accept the outcome
and admit defeat.

22:10.400 --> 22:10.830
Exactly!

22:10.830 --> 22:11.720
You can't!

22:13.750 --> 22:15.240
The strings are all in tune.

22:15.240 --> 22:17.790
Sacrificing one person is now
a clear requirement.

22:17.790 --> 22:19.400
You've contributed the most,

22:19.400 --> 22:20.720
why keep interfering?

22:20.720 --> 22:22.590
Huang Ying doesn't deserve to die.

22:22.590 --> 22:24.440
She's been trying to help everyone
all along

22:24.440 --> 22:25.510
and has never harmed anyone.

22:25.510 --> 22:26.240
If she shouldn't die,

22:26.240 --> 22:27.570
should you die instead?

22:29.400 --> 22:30.270
Or tell us,

22:31.590 --> 22:32.750
who should die?

22:33.880 --> 22:35.000
She's so clumsy.

22:35.110 --> 22:36.570
Even if she gets out alive,

22:36.720 --> 22:38.720
she'll end up as fertilizer anyway.

22:38.720 --> 22:40.650
We might as well sacrifice her now!

22:41.240 --> 22:42.040
That's right.

22:42.310 --> 22:43.310
Get out of the way,

22:43.590 --> 22:45.030
or we won't be polite anymore.

22:45.030 --> 22:46.240
Who made these rules?

22:46.350 --> 22:48.640
If the one who talks the most nonsense
should die,

22:48.640 --> 22:49.920
shouldn't it be you?

22:50.160 --> 22:51.640
If the one with the highest rank
should die,

22:51.640 --> 22:53.000
shouldn't it be you?

22:53.550 --> 22:55.310
Can't you all use your brains?

22:55.960 --> 22:57.830
From the moment we entered
the Courtyard of Mysteries,

22:57.830 --> 22:58.830
every trial

22:59.000 --> 23:00.920
seemed to require us
to compete for credit,

23:00.920 --> 23:01.720
but in reality,

23:01.720 --> 23:03.790
it was our united efforts
that helped us overcome these challenges.

23:03.790 --> 23:05.650
No one can decide another's fate—

23:06.110 --> 23:07.840
not even Dreamshard Immortal.

23:27.590 --> 23:28.350
Xiao Yao.

23:29.190 --> 23:29.790
Dali.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.110
It's always the same ending.

23:35.750 --> 23:36.720
No need to watch.

23:44.400 --> 23:45.460
What are you doing?

23:47.310 --> 23:48.120
Dali.

23:48.720 --> 23:50.780
Don't go further down the wrong path.

23:53.590 --> 23:54.750
We can't waste any more time!

23:54.750 --> 23:56.350
The candle is about to go out!

23:57.070 --> 23:58.870
We need a life for the sacrifice,

23:58.880 --> 24:00.360
or we'll all die here!

24:00.590 --> 24:01.960
Let's just pick up the sword

24:01.960 --> 24:02.720
and kill her!

24:02.840 --> 24:03.370
Let's go.

24:04.350 --> 24:05.020
Catch her!

24:05.160 --> 24:05.920
Don't let her escape!

24:05.920 --> 24:06.480
You can't go!

24:06.480 --> 24:07.180
Kill her!

24:07.590 --> 24:08.200
Kill her!

24:08.310 --> 24:08.880
Kill her!

24:09.110 --> 24:10.110
Stop right there!

24:11.310 --> 24:12.370
Don't hold me back!

24:13.160 --> 24:13.810
Let go!

24:15.790 --> 24:16.790
She must die!

24:17.310 --> 24:17.960
Let go!

24:21.160 --> 24:22.690
If she doesn't die, we will!

24:26.070 --> 24:26.700
Let go!

24:33.280 --> 24:33.940
Huang Ying!

24:34.160 --> 24:35.500
Kill her for me!

24:35.610 --> 24:36.560
Let me go!

24:36.790 --> 24:37.450
Huang Ying!

24:37.830 --> 24:38.600
Let go!

24:39.070 --> 24:39.640
Let me go!

24:39.720 --> 24:40.520
Hold her down!

24:40.750 --> 24:41.200
Don't move!

24:41.200 --> 24:41.990
Let me go!

24:43.590 --> 24:44.200
Come here!

24:44.550 --> 24:45.380
Kill her!

24:46.510 --> 24:47.110
Come here!

24:47.270 --> 24:47.880
Kill her!

24:53.030 --> 24:54.310
Let me go!

24:55.660 --> 24:56.910
Let go!

25:24.220 --> 25:26.910
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

25:28.480 --> 25:31.110
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

25:32.710 --> 25:35.510
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

25:36.620 --> 25:39.540
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

25:41.350 --> 25:44.020
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

25:45.540 --> 25:48.470
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

25:49.760 --> 25:52.620
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

25:53.930 --> 25:56.590
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

26:00.210 --> 26:03.440
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

26:04.680 --> 26:07.860
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

26:09.110 --> 26:12.250
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

26:13.230 --> 26:16.310
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

26:31.110 --> 26:32.310
How is this possible?

26:32.830 --> 26:34.290
How could the sword break?

26:34.590 --> 26:36.630
I didn't see them use any magic.

26:54.200 --> 26:55.000
Huang Ying,

26:55.680 --> 26:56.110
you...

27:23.920 --> 27:25.830
Thank you, Xiao Yao.

27:28.510 --> 27:29.800
Actually, I am

27:29.830 --> 27:32.690
the vengeful spirit
of the Courtyard of Mysteries.

27:39.270 --> 27:40.550
Many years ago,

27:41.110 --> 27:43.770
I came to the Realm of Mist and Void
just like you.

27:43.960 --> 27:45.890
Since I wasn't as clever as others,

27:46.270 --> 27:47.930
I was mocked

27:48.070 --> 27:49.000
and ostracized.

27:50.030 --> 27:53.630
I originally thought that
as long as I treated others sincerely,

27:53.680 --> 27:55.740
I would receive sincerity in return.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.300
But unexpectedly,

27:57.550 --> 27:59.150
my constant forbearance

27:59.200 --> 28:01.130
only led to daily

28:01.310 --> 28:03.310
and increasingly severe bullying.

28:04.070 --> 28:05.000
Eventually,

28:05.680 --> 28:07.480
I committed suicide by hanging.

28:07.830 --> 28:10.690
The Immortal Lord didn't want my soul
to dissipate,

28:11.110 --> 28:12.920
so he condensed my resentment.

28:13.740 --> 28:16.100
Every time newcomers arrive on the island,

28:16.100 --> 28:17.680
he places me among them.

28:18.790 --> 28:19.550
First,

28:20.030 --> 28:21.510
to test people's hearts.

28:22.200 --> 28:22.880
And second,

28:23.240 --> 28:25.200
to give me a chance.

28:26.160 --> 28:28.650
If I meet someone who treats me sincerely,

28:29.070 --> 28:31.000
my resentment can be soothed,

28:31.480 --> 28:34.010
and I can reenter
the cycle of reincarnation.

28:34.160 --> 28:35.400
But every time,

28:36.720 --> 28:40.290
I was despised
for being stupid and clumsy.

28:40.830 --> 28:43.480
Time after time, I got
isolated and rejected,

28:44.440 --> 28:46.370
repeatedly chosen as a sacrifice.

28:47.000 --> 28:49.930
They'd join forces and try to kill me
with that sword,

28:52.610 --> 28:54.170
just like what you did.

28:59.750 --> 29:01.410
So each time, the ones who died

29:02.000 --> 29:04.330
were actually those who tried to kill you.

29:09.110 --> 29:11.480
Testing human hearts again and again

29:12.160 --> 29:14.440
has deepened my resentment.

29:15.250 --> 29:18.380
No one has ever escaped from
the Courtyard of Mysteries.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.440
Only tonight,

29:23.550 --> 29:24.990
I met someone

29:25.590 --> 29:27.790
who truly treated me as a friend.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.830
I also experienced

29:32.750 --> 29:34.920
what it feels like to have someone

29:35.480 --> 29:36.750
act selflessly for me.

29:52.330 --> 29:53.090
Xiao Yao.

29:53.790 --> 29:55.830
Now that the strings are all in place,

29:55.830 --> 29:57.240
how about I play a song

29:57.760 --> 29:58.520
for you?

31:31.880 --> 31:32.720
Ling Yi

31:33.640 --> 31:34.300
and Rou Jia,

31:36.480 --> 31:38.740
go serve at the Spirit Garment Pavilion;

31:40.960 --> 31:41.720
Yun Qi

31:42.440 --> 31:43.200
and Ling Yun—

31:44.440 --> 31:46.040
the Spirit Spring Pavilion;

31:48.310 --> 31:49.110
Ren Shu—

31:51.440 --> 31:52.700
the Biexin Courtyard.

31:54.720 --> 31:55.790
In today's trial,

31:56.750 --> 31:58.350
one person stood out.

31:59.560 --> 32:00.210
Xiao Yao,

32:03.550 --> 32:05.010
you will replace Ying Ning

32:05.200 --> 32:07.860
as the personal attendant
to the Immortal Lord.

32:12.230 --> 32:13.790
I truly appreciate
the Immortal Lord's favor.

32:13.790 --> 32:15.350
But I only entered
the Realm of Mist and Void

32:15.350 --> 32:16.590
to take Hong Ye away.

32:17.240 --> 32:19.640
I hope the Immortal Lord
will grant my wish.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.440
Xiao Yao,

32:22.830 --> 32:25.880
the chance to serve the Immortal Lord
up close is extremely rare.

32:25.880 --> 32:26.880
Don't be foolish.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.620
If there are other trials,

32:28.680 --> 32:30.210
I'm willing to accept them.

32:31.350 --> 32:34.550
I just hope the Immortal Lord
will let Hong Ye and me leave.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.590
Alright then.

32:42.030 --> 32:43.640
I'll report your words truthfully

32:43.640 --> 32:45.030
to the Immortal Lord.

32:45.770 --> 32:47.720
You may now go back to the flower sea
to water the flowers.

32:47.720 --> 32:48.200
Yes.

32:51.200 --> 32:51.790
Dali.

32:52.750 --> 32:53.480
I'm here.

32:54.350 --> 32:56.240
You are rewarded with the position

32:56.240 --> 32:58.640
of personal attendant
to the Immortal Lord.

32:58.640 --> 33:01.240
I'll serve the Immortal Lord
with all my heart.

33:14.700 --> 33:23.180
[Lovely and intelligent]

33:24.810 --> 33:25.480
Xiao Yao.

33:26.340 --> 33:29.830
[Lovely and intelligent]

33:27.720 --> 33:30.250
Why did you turn down
such a good opportunity?

33:31.510 --> 33:34.710
I only want to rescue Hong Ye
and return to Demons' Valley.

33:36.310 --> 33:37.200
At this point,

33:38.030 --> 33:39.830
do you still think you can leave?

33:41.200 --> 33:44.300
You've witnessed what
the Dreamshard Immortal is capable of.

33:44.300 --> 33:47.560
We'll never be able to
get out of this Realm of Mist and Void.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.590
Why not try

33:51.590 --> 33:53.450
to make life better for yourself?

34:02.830 --> 34:03.890
Congratulations.

34:08.210 --> 34:10.370
Why do you always think you're right?

34:35.920 --> 34:36.550
Hong Ye!

34:47.840 --> 34:48.280
Hey!

34:48.719 --> 34:50.190
Are you trying to drown me?

34:50.320 --> 34:51.150
Little Leaf.

34:52.250 --> 34:53.840
Can you sense

34:54.320 --> 34:55.670
how Hong Ye is doing now?

34:56.520 --> 34:57.920
Is he well?

34:58.440 --> 34:59.070
He's fine.

34:59.550 --> 35:00.980
Look, I'm even doing well here.

35:00.980 --> 35:01.760
How could anything happen to him?

35:01.760 --> 35:04.190
Can you summon him here one more time?

35:05.110 --> 35:06.300
I've realized

35:06.360 --> 35:07.760
you either try to drown me

35:07.840 --> 35:09.400
or want me to commit suicide.

35:09.400 --> 35:10.660
Who do you think I am?

35:10.920 --> 35:12.590
I'm just a primordial spirit.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.800
Every time I use my power,

35:14.800 --> 35:16.890
I have to use all my strength.

35:17.190 --> 35:18.050
You should know

35:18.150 --> 35:19.440
the number of times I can use my power

35:19.440 --> 35:20.760
is limited.

35:21.030 --> 35:23.320
Hong Ye only sent me here

35:23.340 --> 35:24.400
to protect you.

35:24.550 --> 35:25.960
If I use my power recklessly,

35:25.960 --> 35:27.880
I'll soon wither like dry grass.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.850
Please don't cry, Xiao Yao.

35:33.880 --> 35:35.840
Take care of yourself first,

35:35.860 --> 35:38.720
so you can be there
when the moment comes to meet him.

35:54.710 --> 35:56.800
Save your breath.

35:58.110 --> 35:59.110
Go ahead and do it.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.000
Are you really free of all attachments?

36:08.230 --> 36:10.190
Is the wound on your face

36:11.150 --> 36:12.510
healing well?

36:16.400 --> 36:18.020
After I perish,

36:18.710 --> 36:21.610
only my sister, Tan'er, will remain.

36:22.190 --> 36:24.670
If you could show mercy, Miss Pianpian,

36:25.230 --> 36:28.440
please spare her from
the torment of the Ghostly Fire.

36:33.430 --> 36:34.700
My power is limited.

36:35.110 --> 36:36.240
The Ghostly Fire

36:36.710 --> 36:39.400
is formed from the vengeful spirits
of the unjustly dead,

36:39.400 --> 36:42.600
and it fights endlessly with
the souls bound to the blade,

36:44.000 --> 36:45.290
never ceasing.

36:47.030 --> 36:48.760
Tan'er and you

36:50.630 --> 36:52.360
share a similar fate.

36:53.400 --> 36:55.840
I truly hope that someday,

36:57.550 --> 37:00.220
you both can leave
this Realm of Mist and Void

37:02.440 --> 37:05.040
and live the life you want.

37:15.070 --> 37:16.070
How did my brother

37:17.880 --> 37:19.480
really die?

37:21.710 --> 37:23.710
He sacrificed his life for justice.

37:27.070 --> 37:28.960
He was a hero.

37:29.190 --> 37:30.920
I'm asking how he sacrificed himself
for justice

37:30.920 --> 37:32.320
and who caused his death.

37:36.840 --> 37:38.300
Since he was a Feiyu Guard,

37:40.400 --> 37:42.000
was he killed by demons?

37:47.150 --> 37:48.860
My answer remains the same.

37:51.230 --> 37:53.670
If you truly want to know the truth,

37:54.920 --> 37:57.320
help me find Tan'er.

37:58.790 --> 38:00.720
After we slay the demonic spirits,

38:02.710 --> 38:05.480
I will tell you everything in detail.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.840
Why won't you give up?

38:09.800 --> 38:13.030
As long as you can lure out
the Dreamshard's true form,

38:15.250 --> 38:18.210
I can surely eliminate it.

38:19.030 --> 38:21.550
Only by leaving
this Realm of Mist and Void

38:25.480 --> 38:28.660
will you understand what you truly want

38:29.440 --> 38:31.590
deep down.

39:53.230 --> 39:53.840
Tan'er.

39:58.230 --> 39:58.840
Tan'er?

40:08.180 --> 40:10.240
Weren't you looking for my true form?

40:10.340 --> 40:11.620
Here I am.

40:14.030 --> 40:15.490
I was confused for a moment

40:15.580 --> 40:16.820
and have let you down, My Lord.
